description         Yet Another Python Profiler.
long_description    The CPython standard distribution comes with \
                    three profilers: cProfile, Profile and hotshot. \
                    The cProfile module is implemented as a C module \
                    based on lsprof, Profile is in pure Python, and \
                    the hotshot can be seen as a small subset of a \
                    cProfile. Unlike any of these profilers, however, \
                    yappi fully supports profiling multi-threaded programs.

homepage            https://github.com/sumerc/yappi

